   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "teal = c^KV (512) + k^R (64) = 576 elements / token / layer\nvs MHA 2*128*128 = 32,768 (1.76%, ~57x smaller).\nStill 8 caches: MLA shrinks the width, not the layer count.",
   "originalText": "teal = c^KV (512) + k^R (64) = 576 elements / token / layer\nvs MHA 2*128*128 = 32,768 (1.76%, ~57x smaller).\nStill 8 caches: MLA shrinks the width, not the layer count.",
