   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retrofit levels (cost to adopt)\nL1 serving: Paged, FlashAttn, KV quant,\n    cont. batching, prefix cache - no retrain\nL2 architecture: MHA->GQA (~5% uptrain),\n    MHA->MLA (SVD + partial RoPE)\nL3 fundamental: Transformer->hybrid, CLA",
   "originalText": "Retrofit levels (cost to adopt)\nL1 serving: Paged, FlashAttn, KV quant,\n    cont. batching, prefix cache - no retrain\nL2 architecture: MHA->GQA (~5% uptrain),\n    MHA->MLA (SVD + partial RoPE)\nL3 fundamental: Transformer->hybrid, CLA",
   "fontSize": 16,
